_at":"2026-11-16T11:15:47Z","assignee":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"status":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8983","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Parent: [#6027](https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/6027) (retrieval statistics, feedback, query traces). Research source: prior-art doc `~/workspace/scratch/atlas-ingestion-brief-2026-11-04/prior-art-research.md` (2026-11-04). Follow-up 24 (Cluster 4). Related: the SPLADE eval harness #5741 (signal-specific; this is the corpus-wide gate).\n\n## Finding (research, in substance)\n\nThe standard operating pattern for retrieval evolution is a **versioned golden set** (50–200 real queries) run on every index/config change with merge gates on thresholds (RAGAS-style reference-free metrics: faithfulness, answer relevancy, context precision/recall; the TruLens RAG triad). The builder's fuel is feedback: practitioner consensus is that **negative-feedback queries get promoted into the evaluation set with corrected ground truth** — \"when users flag incorrect responses, add those queries to your evaluation set\" is the standard loop. For Atlas the golden set converts feedback + traces into decisions: chunking changes, rescore weights (the #5774 parameter surface), and SPLADE/Jaccard experiments all become \"did the golden set move\" questions instead of vibes.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Builder: thumbs-down + sampled queries → candidate eval entries with corrected expected results; human/agent confirmation step; versioning of the set itself.\n- Eval gate: which changes must run it (chunking policy, rescore weights, embedding model, fan-out config), which metrics, what delta blocks a change.\n- Maintenance: stale entries (corpus moved on) — retire/repair rules so the gate doesn't fossilize.\n\n## Done looks like\n\nA builder + gate design: set schema, promotion flow from feedback, gate contract per change class.\n\n<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=muse state=filed source=main-chat-2026-11-04-wave2 -->","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.g